const APP={alin:APPS[0],dl:APPS[1],pnl:APPS[2],rpnl:APPS[3],rtrf:APPS[4],trk:APPS[5],trf:APPS[6],wrp:APPS[7],str:APPS[8]};
const CONDS=[
 {id:"open",t:"Open / exposed ceiling",d:"No grid · 14 ft+",prim:"alin",alt:"wrp"},
 {id:"grid",t:"Grid / drop ceiling",d:"2×2 · 2×4 modules",prim:"trf",alt:"pnl"},
 {id:"relamp",t:"Re-lamp existing housing",d:"Retrofit · keep frame",prim:"rtrf",alt:"rpnl"},
 {id:"accent",t:"Accent & display",d:"Merchandising · focal",prim:"trk",alt:"dl"},
 {id:"util",t:"Corridor, stair & utility",d:"Back-of-house · egress",prim:"str",alt:"wrp"}];
const PANEL_VERTS=["data-center","education","government-military","healthcare"];
const OUT_APPS=[
 {n:"Area / Site",c:"AREA",s:"area-light",k:36},
 {n:"Wall Pack",c:"WP",s:"wall-pack-architectural",k:22},
 {n:"Flood",c:"FLD",s:"flood-light",k:22},
 {n:"Canopy",c:"CNP",s:"canopy",k:6},
 {n:"Bollard",c:"BOL",s:"bollard",k:6},
 {n:"Garage / Structure",c:"GAR",s:"parking-garage",k:6},
 {n:"Roadway",c:"RDWY",s:"roadway",k:21},
 {n:"Security · D2D",c:"SEC",s:"security",k:8},
 {n:"Post-Top",c:"PTP",s:"post-top",k:30},
 {n:"High-Mast",c:"HM",s:"high-mast",k:10}];
const OUT_FIT=[
 [2,2,1,1,0,0,0,1,0,1],
 [1,2,2,0,1,1,1,2,0,1],
 [2,2,1,1,2,1,1,1,2,1],
 [2,2,2,1,1,1,2,2,2,2],
 [2,1,1,2,2,2,1,1,1,0],
 [1,1,2,2,2,1,1,1,2,0],
 [2,2,2,1,0,1,1,2,0,2],
 [2,2,2,1,0,1,1,2,0,2]];
const OUT_CONDS=[
 {id:"lot",t:"Parking lot / open site",d:"Pole-mount · area",prim:0,alt:2},
 {id:"perimeter",t:"Building perimeter / wall",d:"Wall-mount · entry",prim:1,alt:7},
 {id:"facade",t:"Façade & yard floodlighting",d:"Aimed · accent",prim:2,alt:0},
 {id:"covered",t:"Covered drive / canopy",d:"Soffit · drive-thru",prim:3,alt:1},
 {id:"path",t:"Pathway & landscape",d:"Low-level · campus",prim:4,alt:0},
 {id:"deck",t:"Parking structure",d:"Deck · low-profile",prim:5,alt:1}];

const DOMAINS={indoor:{apps:APPS,fit:FIT,seg:"INDOOR · C&I"},outdoor:{apps:OUT_APPS,fit:OUT_FIT,seg:"OUTDOOR · SITE"}};
function primIdx(row){let s=row.indexOf(2);if(s<0)s=row.indexOf(1);return s<0?0:s;}

/* ---- dual-feature directory ---- */
function buildDirectoryDual(listEl,previewEl){
  listEl.innerHTML='';previewEl.innerHTML='';
  VERTS.forEach((v,i)=>{
    const li=document.createElement('li');
    li.className='ed-row'+(i===0?' active':'');li.dataset.i=i;li.tabIndex=0;
    li.innerHTML='<span class="ed-no">0'+(i+1)+'</span><span class="ed-nm">'+v.n+'</span><span class="ed-go">→</span>';
    li.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>activate(i));
    li.addEventListener('focus',()=>activate(i));
    li.addEventListener('click',()=>activate(i));
    listEl.appendChild(li);
    const inApp=APPS[primIdx(FIT[i])],outApp=OUT_APPS[primIdx(OUT_FIT[i])];
    const f=document.createElement('a');
    f.className='ed-frame'+(i===0?' show':'');f.dataset.i=i;f.href=BASE+'/solutions/'+v.s+'/';
    f.innerHTML='<div class="ed-abbr">'+v.a+'</div><div class="ed-meta"><span class="ed-dot"></span>Vertical · '+v.tag+'</div>'+
      '<div class="ed-body"><h2>'+v.n+'</h2><p>'+v.b+'</p>'+
      '<div class="ed-dcards">'+
        '<div class="ed-dcard"><span class="ed-dlabel">Indoor · C&amp;I</span><span class="ed-dname">'+inApp.n+'</span><span class="ed-dcode">'+inApp.c+' · '+inApp.k+' SKUs</span></div>'+
        '<div class="ed-dcard"><span class="ed-dlabel">Outdoor · Site</span><span class="ed-dname">'+outApp.n+'</span><span class="ed-dcode">'+outApp.c+' · '+outApp.k+' SKUs</span></div>'+
      '</div>'+
      '<span class="ed-view">View all '+v.n.split(' ')[0]+' solutions<span class="ed-arr">→</span></span></div>';
    previewEl.appendChild(f);
  });
  function activate(i){
    listEl.querySelectorAll('.ed-row').forEach(r=>r.classList.toggle('active',+r.dataset.i===i));
    previewEl.querySelectorAll('.ed-frame').forEach(f=>f.classList.toggle('show',+f.dataset.i===i));
  }
}

/* ---- coverage matrix with Indoor/Outdoor domain toggle ---- */
function buildToggleMatrix(gridEl,readoutEl,toggleEl){
  let domain='indoor',locked=false;
  function paintToggle(){toggleEl.querySelectorAll('.dom-seg').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('on',b.dataset.d===domain));}
  function build(){
    const D=DOMAINS[domain],apps=D.apps,fit=D.fit;
    document.getElementById('cov-count').textContent=VERTS.length+' × '+apps.length+' · '+D.seg;
    gridEl.style.gridTemplateColumns='190px repeat('+apps.length+',minmax(58px,1fr))';
    gridEl.style.minWidth=(190+apps.length*64)+'px';
    let html='<div class="mx-ch corner">Vertical \\ Form</div>';
    apps.forEach((a,c)=>html+='<div class="mx-ch" data-c="'+c+'" title="'+a.n+'">'+a.c+'</div>');
    VERTS.forEach((v,r)=>{html+='<div class="mx-rh" data-r="'+r+'">'+v.n+'</div>';apps.forEach((a,c)=>{const f=fit[r][c];html+='<div class="mx-cell" data-r="'+r+'" data-c="'+c+'"><span class="mx-dot p'+f+'"></span></div>';});});
    gridEl.innerHTML=html;
    readoutEl.innerHTML='<div class="ro-tag" data-role="tag">'+D.seg+'</div><h3 class="ro-title" data-role="title">Select a pairing</h3><p class="ro-x" data-role="x">—</p><div class="ro-fit" data-role="fit"><span class="ro-d"></span><span>—</span></div><div class="ro-skus" data-role="skus">—</div><div class="ro-sl">SKUs in family</div><a class="ro-cta" data-role="cta" href="#" style="display:none;">View Solutions →</a><p class="ro-hint" data-role="hint">Read down a vertical for everything rated for that environment, or across a row for where one form factor ships. Toggle Indoor / Outdoor to swap the column set.</p>';
    wire(apps,fit);
  }
  function wire(apps,fit){
    const $=s=>readoutEl.querySelector('[data-role="'+s+'"]');
    function clearHL(){gridEl.querySelectorAll('.hl,.cross,.lock').forEach(e=>e.classList.remove('hl','cross','lock'));}
    function focus(r,c,opts){opts=opts||{};clearHL();
      gridEl.querySelectorAll('.mx-cell[data-r="'+r+'"]').forEach(e=>e.classList.add('hl'));
      gridEl.querySelectorAll('.mx-cell[data-c="'+c+'"]').forEach(e=>e.classList.add('hl'));
      gridEl.querySelector('.mx-rh[data-r="'+r+'"]').classList.add('hl');
      gridEl.querySelector('.mx-ch[data-c="'+c+'"]').classList.add('hl');
      const cell=gridEl.querySelector('.mx-cell[data-r="'+r+'"][data-c="'+c+'"]');
      if(cell){cell.classList.add('cross');if(opts.lock)cell.classList.add('lock');}
      const fv=fit[r][c],v=VERTS[r],a=apps[c];
      $('tag').textContent=(opts.lock?'Selected · ':'')+a.c+' · '+v.n.split(' ')[0];
      $('title').textContent=a.n;$('x').textContent='× '+v.n;
      $('fit').innerHTML='<span class="ro-d f'+fv+'"></span><span>'+FITNAME[fv]+'</span>';
      $('skus').textContent=fv?a.k:'0';
      const cta=$('cta');if(fv){cta.style.display='inline-flex';cta.href=BASE+'/solutions/'+v.s+'/?environment='+domain+'&application='+a.s;}else cta.style.display='none';
      $('hint').style.display='none';
      if(opts.lock&&cell)cell.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest',inline:'nearest'});
    }
    gridEl.querySelectorAll('.mx-cell').forEach(cell=>{const r=+cell.dataset.r,c=+cell.dataset.c;
      cell.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{if(!locked)focus(r,c);});
      cell.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!fit[r][c])return; if(locked&&cell.classList.contains('lock')){locked=false;clearHL();focus(r,c);} else {locked=true;focus(r,c,{lock:true});}});});
    gridEl.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{if(!locked)clearHL();});
    gridEl._focus=focus;gridEl._clear=clearHL;
  }
  toggleEl.querySelectorAll('.dom-seg').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{domain=b.dataset.d;locked=false;paintToggle();build();});
  paintToggle();build();
  return {
    focusCell:(dom,r,c)=>{if(dom&&dom!==domain){domain=dom;paintToggle();build();}locked=true;gridEl._focus(r,c,{lock:true});},
    unlock:()=>{locked=false;gridEl._clear();},
    getDomain:()=>domain
  };
}

/* ---- environment-first Quick Spec ---- */
function buildDecisionEnv(paneEl,matrix){
  let st={step:0,env:null,vert:null,cond:null};
  const labels=['Environment','Vertical','Condition','Result'];
  function dots(){return '<ol class="dp-dots">'+labels.map((l,i)=>'<li class="'+(i===st.step?'on':'')+' '+(i<st.step?'done':'')+'"><span class="dp-n">'+(i+1)+'</span><span class="dp-l">'+l+'</span></li>').join('')+'</ol>';}
  function crumbs(){let h='';if(st.env)h+='<span class="dp-crumb">'+(st.env==='indoor'?'Indoor · C&I':'Outdoor · Site')+'</span>';if(st.vert!=null)h+='<span class="dp-crumb">'+VERTS[st.vert].n+'</span>';if(st.cond){const cs=(st.env==='indoor'?CONDS:OUT_CONDS).find(x=>x.id===st.cond);if(cs)h+='<span class="dp-crumb">'+cs.t+'</span>';}return h?'<div class="dp-crumbs">'+h+'</div>':'';}
  function render(){
    let inner='';
    if(st.step===0){inner='<div class="dp-q">Indoor or outdoor?</div><div class="dp-opts"><button class="dp-opt" data-e="indoor">Indoor · C&amp;I<small>Commercial &amp; industrial interiors</small></button><button class="dp-opt" data-e="outdoor">Outdoor · Site<small>Site, area, façade &amp; roadway</small></button></div>';}
    else if(st.step===1){inner=crumbs()+'<div class="dp-q">Where is the job?</div><div class="dp-opts">'+VERTS.map((v,i)=>'<button class="dp-opt" data-i="'+i+'">'+v.n+'</button>').join('')+'</div><button class="dp-back">← Back</button>';}
    else if(st.step===2){const conds=st.env==='indoor'?CONDS:OUT_CONDS;inner=crumbs()+'<div class="dp-q">'+(st.env==='indoor'?'Ceiling condition?':'Mounting context?')+'</div><div class="dp-opts">'+conds.map(c=>'<button class="dp-opt" data-c="'+c.id+'">'+c.t+'<small>'+c.d+'</small></button>').join('')+'</div><button class="dp-back">← Back</button>';}
    else{
      const v=VERTS[st.vert];let prim,alt,col;
      if(st.env==='indoor'){const c=CONDS.find(x=>x.id===st.cond);let pk=c.prim,ak=c.alt;if(st.cond==='grid'&&PANEL_VERTS.includes(v.s)){pk='pnl';ak='trf';}prim=APP[pk];alt=APP[ak];col=APPS.indexOf(prim);}
      else{const c=OUT_CONDS.find(x=>x.id===st.cond);prim=OUT_APPS[c.prim];alt=OUT_APPS[c.alt];col=c.prim;}
      if(matrix&&matrix.focusCell)matrix.focusCell(st.env,st.vert,col);
      inner=crumbs()+'<div class="dp-rec-tag">Recommended</div><h3 class="dp-rec">'+prim.n+'</h3><div class="dp-skus"><b>'+prim.k+'</b><span>SKUs available</span></div><p class="dp-why">Rated for '+v.n.split(' ')[0]+' '+(st.env==='indoor'?'interiors':'site')+'. Alternate: '+alt.n+'.</p><a class="dp-cta" href="'+BASE+'/solutions/'+v.s+'/?environment='+st.env+'&application='+prim.s+'">View '+prim.n+' →</a><a class="dp-cta alt" href="'+BASE+'/collections/'+st.env+'/?application='+prim.s+'">All '+prim.n+'</a><button class="dp-restart">↻ Start over</button>';
    }
    paneEl.innerHTML=dots()+'<div class="dp-pane">'+inner+'</div>';
    paneEl.querySelectorAll('.dp-opt[data-e]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{st.env=b.dataset.e;st.step=1;render();});
    paneEl.querySelectorAll('.dp-opt[data-i]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{st.vert=+b.dataset.i;st.step=2;render();});
    paneEl.querySelectorAll('.dp-opt[data-c]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{st.cond=b.dataset.c;st.step=3;render();});
    paneEl.querySelectorAll('.dp-back').forEach(bk=>bk.onclick=()=>{st.step=Math.max(0,st.step-1);render();});
    const rs=paneEl.querySelector('.dp-restart');if(rs)rs.onclick=()=>{st={step:0,env:null,vert:null,cond:null};if(matrix&&matrix.unlock)matrix.unlock();render();};
  }
  render();
}

buildDirectoryDual(document.getElementById('ed-list'),document.getElementById('ed-preview'));
const mx=buildToggleMatrix(document.getElementById('mx-grid'),document.getElementById('mx-readout'),document.getElementById('dom-toggle'));
buildDecisionEnv(document.getElementById('dp-pane'),mx);

/* ambient glow follows scroll · respects reduced-motion */
(function(){
  const orb=document.querySelector('.glow-orb');if(!orb)return;
  const reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  let curX=innerWidth*0.4,curY=innerHeight*0.4;
  function target(){const max=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-innerHeight;const f=max>0?Math.min(1,Math.max(0,scrollY/max)):0;
    return {tx:innerWidth*(0.40-0.22*Math.sin(f*Math.PI)),ty:innerHeight*(0.30+0.66*f)};}
  function tick(){const t=target();curX+=(t.tx-curX)*0.04;curY+=(t.ty-curY)*0.04;orb.style.transform='translate('+curX+'px,'+curY+'px) translate(-50%,-50%)';requestAnimationFrame(tick);}
  if(reduce){const t=target();orb.style.transform='translate('+t.tx+'px,'+t.ty+'px) translate(-50%,-50%)';}else requestAnimationFrame(tick);
})();
})();
</script>
